1042	  /**
1043	   * §4 and §12's holds, one world tick: a connected player moored at a dock, out of any duel and holding E works on
1044	   * E's target there (`interactTarget`). The same target as their hold continues it; another starts a new hold from
1045	   * zero; no E, no mooring or no target cancels it (the ledger's rule: progress resets). Starting one ends protection
